143
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:34,800
Instead, the orchestrator is tested

144
00:05:32,080 --> 00:05:37,600
against humanity's last exam, a data set

145
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:39,280
of PhD level questions. Most language

146
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:41,680
models fail these because they lack

147
00:05:39,280 --> 00:05:44,400
specialized domain computations. The

148
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:46,080
orchestrator succeeds to be solved. Then

149
00:05:44,400 --> 00:05:48,720
there is the frames benchmark which

150
00:05:46,080 --> 00:05:50,800
tests multihop factual reasoning. When

151
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:52,960
the model retrieves data, the tool might

152
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:55,280
