163
00:06:15,840 --> 00:06:20,080
capability with strict turn limits,

164
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:21,759
whereas true production reliability

165
00:06:20,080 --> 00:06:23,759
requires ensuring the model doesn't

166
00:06:21,759 --> 00:06:27,120
enter an infinite loop that racks up a

167
00:06:23,759 --> 00:06:29,199
$10,000 server bill. To gauge that cost,

168
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:31,440
researchers often use an accuracy per

169
00:06:29,199 --> 00:06:33,360
