170
00:06:31,440 --> 00:06:36,000
rate between accuracy and cost is

171
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:39,120
flawed. In medical diagnosis or legal

172
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:41,680
analysis, 99% accuracy has massive

173
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:44,400
value, while 90% accuracy carries

174
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:46,960
crippling liability. Rewarding a model

175
00:06:44,400 --> 00:06:49,440
