176
00:06:46,960 --> 00:06:51,600
dangerous in high stakes environments.

177
00:06:49,440 --> 00:06:54,560
When deploying an agentic system,

178
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:56,720
engineering teams face a stark choice. A

179
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:58,960
single monolithic model offers high

180
00:06:56,720 --> 00:07:02,000
reliability for simple, low volume

181
00:06:58,960 --> 00:07:03,919
tasks. A hard-coded rule-based router

