183
00:07:03,919 --> 00:07:08,240
stable, narrow workflows. The

184
00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:10,800
reinforcement learning orchestrator sits

185
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:12,880
in a different category entirely. Built

186
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:15,919
for high volume dynamic environments

187
00:07:12,880 --> 00:07:17,919
where task types constantly shift. This

188
00:07:15,919 --> 00:07:20,800
table shows the core trade-off at the

189
00:07:17,919 --> 00:07:22,800
heart of modern AI architecture. Using a

190
00:07:20,800 --> 00:07:24,560
trained orchestrator trades massive

191
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:26,880
